      "text": "What PermitPath does\nPermitPath assembles municipal permit applications for specialty contractors. It reads the project scope, selects the right jurisdiction forms, fills them from the contractor's records and tracks the submission status.\nThe workflow\nPermitPath works inside the municipal permit filing that the business already runs every week. Nothing about the existing process has to change first.\nPricing · About",
